        "translator": "K. M. K. Murthy / Desiraju Hanumanta Rao",
        "text": "\"Then seeing the arrangements for the anointment of Rama as crown-prince, Kaikeyi, the dear wife and a queen of Dasaratha, solicited boons that were once accorded to her by Dasharatha, for the banishment of Rama and anointment of Bharata as boons. [1-1-21b, 22]"
      }
    ],
